From 906b0915a9d925d15715a3f171e5ac1001c5de12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:16:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/31] [Test] dcp: Cover the DP-attention prefill fan-out to a
 DCP4 decode

One attn-TP1 prefill rank without a draft feeds all four DCP decode
ranks; each rank must hold exactly its owned rows, and the decode's
NextN entry must stay untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
---
